    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont see it that way. it feels like trying to build a sandcastle while the tide is coming in. all this \"meaning\" and \"connection\" is just more noise that's going to be erased anyway. if nothing matters in the end, then isn't all the struggle just pointless? why do we even have to keep pretending that it's worth it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
